u can find them quickly every time you open the talent tree.Balance ChangesReduced adventure progress cost for Regional Bosses and Dungeons | Taking them on is now more rewarding. Thank you to everyone who downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you run into any issues or have ideas, let me know in the Discussions. I read every post. If you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:53:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941425","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1846018067931921","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay Experience Improvements","summary":"Feature UpdatesImproved consumable usage and displayImproved the tutorial so first-time players can get up to speed faster Balance ChangesBuffed several underperforming skills Thank you to everyone who downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you run into any issues or have any thoughts, come tell me on the Discussions board. I read every single post. If you haven't wishlisted the full game yet, now's a great time.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T01:55:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931921","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1845383656387108","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"Quality of Life Improvements","summary":"New FeaturesAfter a defeat, you can now choose to start a new run with the same talent setupHold ALT to compare equipment Balance ChangesAdjusted the growth curve of elite monsters Thank you to every player who has downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you run into any issues or have any ideas, feel free to let me know in the Discussions. I read every single post. If you haven't wishlisted the full game yet, now's a great time to do it.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T17:04:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387108","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1844115010501960","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"Combat Assist System","summary":"New Feature: Combat Assist SystemMore Relaxed Combat | You can now enable auto-cast for each skill individually, greatly cutting down on manual input. Balance ChangesReduced overall enemy strength. Thank you to everyone who has downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you hit a problem or have any thoughts, come tell me in the Discussions — I read every single one. And if you haven't added it to your wishlist yet, now's a good time.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T16:56:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501960","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1844115010489839","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes and Balance Adjustments","summary":"Balance AdjustmentsAdjusted some skills.Adjusted some talents.Bug FixesFixed some talents not working as intended.Thank you to everyone who downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you run into any issues or have any thoughts, let me know in the Discussions. I read every single post. If you haven't wishlisted the full game yet, now's a great time.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T18:11:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489839","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1843481262696970","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"Added character data viewing on the leaderboard","summary":"Balance ChangesAdjusted several skills.Adjusted several talents.Adjusted the prices and effects of some shop itemsNew FeaturesThe leaderboard now saves your character data for each run, but this only applies to data recorded after this update.Bug FixesFixed several UI display errorsThank you to everyone who has downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you run into any issues or have ideas to share, head over to the Discussions board and let me know — I read every single post. And if you haven't wishlist","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T05:51:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1843481262689935","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"UI improvements and multiple bug fixes","summary":"Balance ChangesAdjusted several skills.Adjusted several talents.Rebalanced map node distribution so each node type is spread out more evenly.Feature UpdatesConsumables can now stack in inventory slots.The combat log now correctly displays blocks and dodges.Bug FixesFixed several talents not working as intended.Thank you to everyone who has downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you run into any issues or have ideas, let me know in the Discussions — I read every single post. And if you haven't wishlist","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T17:18:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262689935","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1842846814456160","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"More Useful Items in Andrea's Shop","summary":"New Content: Useful ItemsA New Way to Play｜Several new items have been added, including some you can use on the world map — curious to see what adventurers pull off with them!Where to Find Them｜Sold at the shop in Andrea Balance ChangesRegeneration-per-second affixes and buff values increased across the boardAdjustments to several talents.Added several \\ equipment affixes, and adjusted some existing onesBug FixesFixed a softlock caused by using a Return to Camp scroll while the final boss was pr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T16:12:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456160","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1842846814449281","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"UI info and map node improvements","summary":"Balance ChangesAdjusted several skills.Adjusted several talents.Adjusted map node distribution so the different node types are spread more evenly.Feature UpdatesImproved the UI and control display.Added a damage breakdown — you can now review the damage details of your last battle on the results screen.Thank you to everyone who has downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you hit a problem or have any thoughts, come tell me in the Discussions — I read every single one. And if you haven't added it to you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T15:45:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449281","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1842846814442371","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"The Final Hour: Twelve Notches, Then Midnight","summary":"New Content: The Final HourThe End Is Only the Beginning｜After the final boss is defeated, she will return to fight you in progressively stronger forms. Unlock Condition｜The Final Hour begins automatically upon defeating the final boss. Balance ChangesAdjustments to several skills.Adjustments to several talents.Reworked map node layouts so the connections between nodes suit exploration better.Feature UpdatesAdded a Camp Teleport Scroll to the world map, usable an unlimited number of times, letti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T06:19:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442371","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1842212951311115","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"UI & Tutorial Improvements","summary":"Balance ChangesAdjustments to several skills.Adjustments to several talents.Feature UpdatesImproved UI and control prompts.Streamlined tutorial steps so new players get up to speed faster.Thank you to everyone who has downloaded Andrea - Prologue. If you run into problems or have any thoughts, come tell me in the Discussions — I read every single one. And if you haven't wishlisted the full game yet, now's a good time.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T18:13:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5139300-1842212951307674","game_id":"steam-5139300","kind":"announcement","title":"Dungeons Have Appeared in Andrea","summary":"The Great Sundering didn't only leave its wounds on the surface. As you travel, you'll start to 